    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60381" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτίννυμι</span></b> , collat. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτείνω</span>, <i><span class="en">
			App.
			<u>BC</u>
			1.71
		</span></i> (vv.ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτεινύντες,
		κτειννύντες</span>), <i><span class="en">
			4.35
		</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτιννύω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Polyaen.
			1.23
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			25
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plot.
			3.2.15
		</span></i>:—
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτιννύμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτιννύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					18.8.3
				</span></i>
			:—more freq. in compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκτίννυμι</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκτείνυμι</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.51
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτεινύω</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκτιννύναι</span> are correct acc. to
			Choerob.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.Ox.</u>
				2.233
			</span></i>.</div>
